# APP PLAN — gates

1. Artifact: `memory-bank/app/plan/<epic_id>/md/plan.md` (+ `prompt.md` when board projection is used).
2. The plan must define product outcome, contract (method/path, in/out, errors, roles), UI journey, wire completion and independent tests.
3. One APP epic owns backend + frontend + wire. BACK/FRONT are referenced as surfaces/owners only; do not create an INTEG child epic.
4. Finish only with a resolved decision, explicit non-goals, ownership matrix, QA charter and a path to DECOMPOSE.

Abort: foundation-only without follow-up epic, missing contract, unresolved product decision, or split done criteria.
